{"seq":4,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deep-link-testing","title":"深链测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/engineering/deep-link-testing","wordCount":673,"readingTime":3},{"seq":2,"slug":"analytics-attribution","title":"分析与归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/engineering/analytics-attribution","wordCount":998,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"link-migration-versioning","title":"迁移与版本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/engineering/link-migration-versioning","wordCount":1279,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"工程实践\">工程实践</h1><p>深链的工程实践层处理从测试验证到线上运营的全生命周期问题。本章覆盖深链测试体系（如何在 CI/CD 中自动化验证深链）、分析与归因（深链如何与 UTM 参数、SKAN、MTA 协同构建归因体系），以及链接迁移与版本管理（如何安全地变更深链结构并保持向后兼容）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>内容摘要</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"deep-link-testing\">深链测试</a></td>\n<td>XCUITest/Espresso 深链验证、Firebase Test Lab、Branch 链接验证工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"analytics-attribution\">分析与归因</a></td>\n<td>UTM 参数整合、MTA 模型、Last-click 归因、iOS SKAN 归因框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"link-migration-versioning\">迁移与版本管理</a></td>\n<td>链接版本策略、重定向链管理、短链服务、链接迁移 Playbook</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三个维度共同支撑深链系统在生产环境中的可靠运行：测试确保上线质量，归因追踪业务价值，迁移管理保证长期可维护性。</p>\n"}